# Keep the build context to the few files the image actually needs. Without
# this, `docker build .` would ship the cohorts in work/, the 29 MB release in
# data/, and both reference clones in refs/ to the daemon on every build.
*
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!inference.py
!src/

# Nothing generated, even from inside src/.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
